/0c6548a95b2a81c7dcde33ead78ee0be8d5cee936edc1e2a98c2d59d259404b7.png)\n\nThe complex number $z$ lies in the third quadrant of the complex plane. Therefore $\\pi <\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z)<\\frac{3\\pi }{2}.$ If $\\alpha $ is the angle that $z$ makes with the negative real axis, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\alpha  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{2}{3})≈0.588\\,00.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z)≈\\pi +0.588\\,00≈3.73\n$$\n\nto two decimal places." 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277322 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277323 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277324 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277325 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277326 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1041 "selection" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1104 #edb/ref 17592186277324 13194139534091 true] [17592186277321 1110 #uuid "af3e69f7-bad0-529a-b47f-8633cbb54286" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277322 1034 "3.53" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277322 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534091 true] [17592186277322 1111 #uuid "da385ac4-15bb-5baa-ad0d-ef1ed56a3a29" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277323 1034 "3.37" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277323 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534091 true] [17592186277323 1111 #uuid "0370af9b-2364-5f2d-b604-099c3aaed1c0" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277324 1034 "3.73" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277324 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534091 true] [17592186277324 1111 #uuid "693715a4-a3d0-5def-85bd-e613ba22256a" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277325 1034 "3.35" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277325 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534091 true] [17592186277325 1111 #uuid "a82e2052-e69d-510f-8cb9-c2f1dda72994" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277326 1034 "7.33" 13194139534091 true] [17592186277326 1103 #edb/